  "script_text": "This is the Food Line briefing for June 10, 2026.\n\nToday's briefing is based on 1 current public signal selected from 29 reviewed records.\n\nFood Bank of Northwest Louisiana is providing summer meals and groceries to children and families. Meeting need has become increasingly difficult. Rising food costs and lower donations have left the pantry with one of its lowest inventory levels in years, and inventory is about 31% lower than at the same time last year. The food bank says it has capacity..., as school-meal gaps add strain.\n\nThe Northwest Louisiana signal points to tighter pantry supply and fewer food options.\n\nNo additional current Food Line signal qualified today.\n\nSource links, excerpts, and background references are available in the public source table.\n\nThis has been the Food Line briefing from The Blue Fern Co.",
